			"url": "https://github.com/home-assistant/architecture/discussions/1287",
			"summary": "A maintainer proposes renaming user-facing 'Add-ons' to 'Apps' in the UI and docs, since users confuse them with integrations; APIs stay unchanged, and alternatives such as keeping the name, Services, Packages or Modules are weighed and rejected. A later edit switches the proposal from 'Applications' to 'Apps' based on feedback.",
